---
import { cta, site } from '../../lib/site';
---

<section id="book" class="border-y border-ticket-rule bg-cream">
	<div class="container-page py-section">
		<div class="grid items-start gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[7fr_5fr] lg:gap-16">
			<div class="max-w-3xl">
				<h2 class="text-h2 font-semibold">Bring one real order. Leave knowing whether this fits.</h2>
				<p class="mt-5 max-w-[60ch] text-lede text-ink-soft">
					In fifteen minutes, we&rsquo;ll put your menu and guest count through CostCook and look at
					the quote, shopping, prep, and pack plan it produces. Use your numbers, not a sales demo&rsquo;s.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="border-t border-ticket-rule pt-6 lg:mt-3">
				<h3 class="text-h3 font-semibold">A practical working session</h3>
				<p class="mt-3 text-ink-soft">
					CostCook is still early. We&rsquo;ll talk plainly about what fits, what needs setup, and what
					does not belong in the product.
				</p>
				<a
					href={cta.href}
					target={cta.target}
					rel={cta.rel}
					aria-label={cta.ariaLabel}
					class="btn-primary mt-7"
				>
					{cta.label}
				</a>
				<p class="mt-4 text-sm text-ink-soft">
					Prefer to talk or text? <a href={site.phoneHref} class="font-medium text-green-deep underline decoration-current underline-offset-4">{site.phone}</a>.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
